(129, 1, '2025-03-12 12:58:31', '2025-03-12 12:58:31', '<!-- wp:image {\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1073261888149191&amp;set=pcb.1073307704811276&amp;__cft__[0]=AZVZPRmqVWwFfzPndti0I-eWUvFz-Jv0Oa_abyKZUDds0Zi5RE7bgFlunBRZ0iO2UM6RCh2aG-VmCg2x_hvzmABw_4IMbZfQ_4m-ft3AONQhhCWYNLPn7GUTjfnKablEz3eoCGqPyq7TPfYiKhtqm-MSHVhravc3WtZe758RWsXlfUgJK6T6rUOG0UFdWzQcBPU&amp;__tn__=*bH-R\"><img src=\"https://scontent.fbrs4-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/482083291_1073307791477934_1998238574601958712_n.jpg?stp=cp6_dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=101&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=0ymvFYjkXlIQ7kNvgH9iYgV&amp;_nc_oc=Adi5q5q1aWn_xaThCChgnJezP0U5fJlMie2Xc2LS64Pqzxc26v17H_-f78M6Qs5oMnPkrgabQM9obalaNOhyYBYC&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fbrs4-1.fna&amp;_nc_gid=AQv6npj_usZMYTO2Rv-8Sag&amp;oh=00_AYHyumH0HIWuS6Ov0mSL9jCRPvYysUVMPTLduqqLf7b29w&amp;oe=67D75419\" alt=\"\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a></a>有時旅行的時候，會不經意經過一個地方，感覺到那個地方的氣場不太一樣，然後忍不住停下來拍幾張照，這就是這樣的一個地方，我在威尼斯巷弄間遊走時偶然路過，受到一股典雅靜蘊的氣息吸引，駐足，而後入內參觀，結果驚為天人。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>一樓的幾幅畫作已經很有看頭，走上石梯，進入二樓大堂，下巴直接掉了下來，四面八方滿滿地大作精雕細琢，太多、太精彩。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>仰頭看到脖子酸後，發現原來館方有提供幾面大方鏡，放在石梯入大堂左轉到底的長桌上，不過鏡子頗重，拿著看天花板的畫作，脖子不酸換手酸。仔細徹底地看完二樓，還有三樓，從旁邊的小門上去，展示一些宗教法器和一幅修復中的壁畫。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>事後查詢相關資料，發現此處旅遊部落客較少提到，就連官網上資料也不多，低調到不行。希望有更多人到威尼斯玩能到訪此處，絕對值回票價（門票只有10歐，大約台幣340元）。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1073265738148806&amp;set=pcb.1073307704811276&amp;__cft__[0]=AZVZPRmqVWwFfzPndti0I-eWUvFz-Jv0Oa_abyKZUDds0Zi5RE7bgFlunBRZ0iO2UM6RCh2aG-VmCg2x_hvzmABw_4IMbZfQ_4m-ft3AONQhhCWYNLPn7GUTjfnKablEz3eoCGqPyq7TPfYiKhtqm-MSHVhravc3WtZe758RWsXlfUgJK6T6rUOG0UFdWzQcBPU&amp;__tn__=*bH-R\"></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1073265738148806&amp;set=pcb.1073307704811276&amp;__cft__[0]=AZVZPRmqVWwFfzPndti0I-eWUvFz-Jv0Oa_abyKZUDds0Zi5RE7bgFlunBRZ0iO2UM6RCh2aG-VmCg2x_hvzmABw_4IMbZfQ_4m-ft3AONQhhCWYNLPn7GUTjfnKablEz3eoCGqPyq7TPfYiKhtqm-MSHVhravc3WtZe758RWsXlfUgJK6T6rUOG0UFdWzQcBPU&amp;__tn__=*bH-R\"><img src=\"https://scontent.fbrs4-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/481276336_1073307774811269_7213993467650433975_n.jpg?stp=cp6_dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=110&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=6M4_TeV_iAAQ7kNvgFHlumL&amp;_nc_oc=Adg9sBMaN-2zdFFsnhXnXYsE0enLh6D_OVyT8DjHpHWAIIpkIwG9hoTltQJnAdFlBy2S0BAm3XooiOGGZXG4Dyhn&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fbrs4-1.fna&amp;_nc_gid=AQv6npj_usZMYTO2Rv-8Sag&amp;oh=00_AYHf8TZM8fjeIlMOqZCD7wNwRGhKdtA5S_sFVCSZ9ZtYaw&amp;oe=67D754B9\" alt=\"\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1073261871482526&amp;set=pcb.1073307704811276&amp;__cft__[0]=AZVZPRmqVWwFfzPndti0I-eWUvFz-Jv0Oa_abyKZUDds0Zi5RE7bgFlunBRZ0iO2UM6RCh2aG-VmCg2x_hvzmABw_4IMbZfQ_4m-ft3AONQhhCWYNLPn7GUTjfnKablEz3eoCGqPyq7TPfYiKhtqm-MSHVhravc3WtZe758RWsXlfUgJK6T6rUOG0UFdWzQcBPU&amp;__tn__=*bH-R\"></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1073261871482526&amp;set=pcb.1073307704811276&amp;__cft__[0]=AZVZPRmqVWwFfzPndti0I-eWUvFz-Jv0Oa_abyKZUDds0Zi5RE7bgFlunBRZ0iO2UM6RCh2aG-VmCg2x_hvzmABw_4IMbZfQ_4m-ft3AONQhhCWYNLPn7GUTjfnKablEz3eoCGqPyq7TPfYiKhtqm-MSHVhravc3WtZe758RWsXlfUgJK6T6rUOG0UFdWzQcBPU&amp;__tn__=*bH-R\"><img src=\"https://scontent.fbrs4-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/480904873_1073307824811264_8438588542411775749_n.jpg?stp=cp6_dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=100&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=Hk6szfvJl3EQ7kNvgG5yfra&amp;_nc_oc=AdhPCVYP1aOZPiOjNoEiEVfJWlgL4gUIyX_MkbVyVoUr7X148sw6oy_xt8gEuaRDIC3Fldmd_e9k1tDKx7_c0umz&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fbrs4-1.fna&amp;_nc_gid=AQv6npj_usZMYTO2Rv-8Sag&amp;oh=00_AYFx0UdspFM-k4mOlQ8ddZN1IWriFMoYdNh78YMyPjl8gA&amp;oe=67D74B9C\" alt=\"\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1073261888149191&amp;set=pcb.1073307704811276&amp;__cft__[0]=AZVZPRmqVWwFfzPndti0I-eWUvFz-Jv0Oa_abyKZUDds0Zi5RE7bgFlunBRZ0iO2UM6RCh2aG-VmCg2x_hvzmABw_4IMbZfQ_4m-ft3AONQhhCWYNLPn7GUTjfnKablEz3eoCGqPyq7TPfYiKhtqm-MSHVhravc3WtZe758RWsXlfUgJK6T6rUOG0UFdWzQcBPU&amp;__tn__=*bH-R\"></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1073261928149187&amp;set=pcb.1073307704811276&amp;__cft__[0]=AZVZPRmqVWwFfzPndti0I-eWUvFz-Jv0Oa_abyKZUDds0Zi5RE7bgFlunBRZ0iO2UM6RCh2aG-VmCg2x_hvzmABw_4IMbZfQ_4m-ft3AONQhhCWYNLPn7GUTjfnKablEz3eoCGqPyq7TPfYiKhtqm-MSHVhravc3WtZe758RWsXlfUgJK6T6rUOG0UFdWzQcBPU&amp;__tn__=*bH-R\"></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1073261928149187&amp;set=pcb.1073307704811276&amp;__cft__[0]=AZVZPRmqVWwFfzPndti0I-eWUvFz-Jv0Oa_abyKZUDds0Zi5RE7bgFlunBRZ0iO2UM6RCh2aG-VmCg2x_hvzmABw_4IMbZfQ_4m-ft3AONQhhCWYNLPn7GUTjfnKablEz3eoCGqPyq7TPfYiKhtqm-MSHVhravc3WtZe758RWsXlfUgJK6T6rUOG0UFdWzQcBPU&amp;__tn__=*bH-R\"><img src=\"https://scontent.fbrs4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/476392219_1073307848144595_1219568717972072628_n.jpg?stp=cp6_dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=102&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=d7O_x_5U4NUQ7kNvgE2a5jE&amp;_nc_oc=AdgbCXyOdYCeTp0Ptpov2KIgcNYv46l3yLwCXU1skkUXhtDAdttgva70qhcrEYxyWSi5wHQtW7XVGhTbOhmDNB6w&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fbrs4-2.fna&amp;_nc_gid=AQv6npj_usZMYTO2Rv-8Sag&amp;oh=00_AYENGguN5s09OT3DgsddIA0u7MwtDMRqNCYTsxTAfYprjw&amp;oe=67D7496A\" alt=\"\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ad_center/create/boostpost/?ad_account_id=299396001511118&amp;entry_point=www_profile_plus_timeline&amp;page_id=103583071654841&amp;target_id=1073307704811276&amp;__cft__[0]=AZVZPRmqVWwFfzPndti0I-eWUvFz-Jv0Oa_abyKZUDds0Zi5RE7bgFlunBRZ0iO2UM6RCh2aG-VmCg2x_hvzmABw_4IMbZfQ_4m-ft3AONQhhCWYNLPn7GUTjfnKablEz3eoCGqPyq7TPfYiKhtqm-MSHVhravc3WtZe758RWsXlfUgJK6T6rUOG0UFdWzQcBPU&amp;__tn__=*W-R\"></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', '聖羅格大會堂（Scuola Grande di San Rocco）', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '128-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 12:58:31', '2025-03-12 12:58:31', '', 128, 'http://localhost/chi-website/?p=129', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
