(147, 1, '2025-03-12 16:28:58', '2025-03-12 16:28:58', '<!-- wp:image {\"id\":148,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost/chi-website/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/威爾斯聖誕市集.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-148\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>週末去了威爾斯首都卡地夫的聖誕市集，剛好天冷，地上撒鹽防結冰，乍看似冰晶，更添幾許冬日氣息。市集上，熱紅酒香味滿溢，聖誕歌充盈耳際，還沒12月，節慶氣氛卻已濃烈。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":150,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost/chi-website/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/卡地夫聖誕市集.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-150\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->', '卡地夫聖誕市集', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e5%8d%a1%e5%9c%b0%e5%a4%ab%e8%81%96%e8%aa%95%e5%b8%82%e9%9b%86', '', '', '2025-03-12 16:29:52', '2025-03-12 16:29:52', '', 0, 'http://localhost/chi-website/?p=147', 0, 'post', '', 0),
